## Why This Is Asked
This question probes multi-tenant data governance, isolation, and automation at scale in GCP.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant IAM and least privilege bindings
- VPC Service Controls and boundary design
- BigQuery, Pub/Sub, and Cloud Storage isolation patterns
- Automated onboarding/offboarding and cost controls
- End-to-end auditing with Cloud Audit Logs and Eventarc

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo example: build per-tenant IAM policy and apply
function buildTenantPolicy(tenantSA){
  return {
    bindings: [
      { role: 'roles/bigquery.dataViewer', members: [`serviceAccount:${tenantSA}`] },
      { role: 'roles/pubsub.subscriber', members: [`serviceAccount:${tenantSA}`] }
    ]
  };
}
// applyPolicy(projectId, tenantPolicy)
```

